.\" Installed by cmake --install and by the Debian package. The version is the
.\" same frozen Git identity compiled into the executable.
.TH CORELET 1 "August 2026" "corelet @CORELET_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
corelet \- MeshCore companion app for the ClockworkPi uConsole
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B corelet
.RB [ \-H
.IR host ]
.RB [ \-p
.IR port ]
.RB [ \-b
.IR device ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B corelet
is a chat window for a MeshCore node. It reaches the node either through a
.BR umeshcored (8)
companion daemon over TCP, or directly over Bluetooth LE, lists the node's
configured channels and sends and receives messages on them.
.PP
It is a client only: all radio work, crypto and channel state live in the
daemon or in the device firmware.
.PP
Started with no target, the app asks for one and remembers the answer. Naming
a target on the command line skips that dialog.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-H ", " \-\-host " " \fIhost\fR
Host running the MeshCore daemon. Defaults to 127.0.0.1.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-port " " \fIport\fR
Companion port on that host, matching the daemon's
.I companion_port
setting. Defaults to 5000.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-ble " " \fIdevice\fR
Reach a MeshCore device over Bluetooth LE instead, named either by its
advertised name or by the address the local adapter knows it as.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a usage summary and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/singular0/corelet/history/<public\-key>.sqlite3
Message history, one database per node. Collecting a message removes it from
the daemon's inbox, so this file is the only copy.
.TP
.I ~/.config/singular0/corelet.conf
Window geometry, the connection target and the offline channel cache.
.SH SECURITY
The companion protocol has
.B no authentication.
The daemon binds loopback by default; only point
.B corelet
at another host across a network you control.
.PP
Channel messages carry the sender's name in their text and nothing signs it,
so a name shown next to a message is a claim, not an identity.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR umeshcored (8)
